Description: Fix CVE-2026-59642 - bind CMS AuthenticatedData content to MAC via messageDigest
 When authenticated attributes are present, RFC 5652 sec. 9.3 MACs DER(authAttrs)
 rather than the content. The content is bound only through the messageDigest
 attribute; RecipientInformation exposed getContentDigest() but never compared it,
 so callers checking only getMac() accepted content substitution. getMac() now
 verifies the recovered content digest against messageDigest and throws
 CMSRuntimeException on mismatch; getContentDigest() caches the digest so it is
 idempotent.
